     <td><para unique="1261215">AES</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261217">Perform one round of an AES encryption flow, using one 128-bit data (state) from xmm1 with one 128-bit round key from xmm2/m128.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261219">VEX.128.66.0F38.WIG DC /r</para>
