     <td><para unique="1261228">AES</para>
      <para unique="1261229">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261231">Perform one round of an AES encryption flow, using one 128-bit data (state) from xmm2 with one 128-bit round key from the xmm3/m128; store the result in xmm1.</para>
